# Env vars re-exported into the sbx agent sandbox for THIS repo only.
# Names only (values come from your op-env/mise-loaded shell). Safe to commit.
# Consumed by ~/.local/bin/sbx (os-configs supply-chain package).
#
# Required by .mcp.json MCP servers (github / context7) — without these the
# servers fail to start inside the sandbox (--clearenv strips them otherwise):
GITHUB_PAT_NIGHT_ORCH
CONTEXT7_API_KEY
MAX_MCP_OUTPUT_TOKENS
